headSha: resolveHeadSha(repoInfo, ticket) — ticket has no pr.headSha → issues github_get_pr for the CLOSED source PR → head.sha still available for closed PRs → returns the head sha. Or null if deleted — then resolveTransplantSha falls back to marker.head (recorded). Good.

