{"content":"**Fixed by dropping the field** (the minimal of your two options).

`guestExec` (js/smAgent.js) returns `{ out }` only. `cli_execute_command` signals failure by throwing, so `ok` was hardwired `true` and unread; every call site either consumes `.out` or lets the throw propagate — which stays exactly as it was (the merge step's typed-conflict catch and `guestBranchExists`'s own try/catch were untouched). No behavior change, one dead field fewer.
